      "worked": "For $(x+4)^6$,\n$$T_k=\\binom{6}{k}x^{6-k}4^k.$$\nThe $x^4$ term has $k=2$, so its coefficient is $\\binom{6}{2}4^2=240$.\n\nFor $(2x+3)^8$,\n$$T_k=\\binom{8}{k}2^{8-k}3^kx^{8-k}.$$\nThe $x^4$ term has $k=4$, so its coefficient is $\\binom{8}{4}2^43^4=90\\,720$.\n\nThe required coefficient is\n$$\\begin{align*}240+90\\,720&=90\\,960.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
